    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27723" root="ظهر" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَهَرَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>goods,</i> or <i>furniture and utensils, of a
house</i> or <i>tent;</i> (IAar, S, O, K, TA;) as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهَرَةٌ</span>: (IAar, TA:) or the former signifies the
<i>exterior of a house,</i> or <i>tent;</i> and the latter, the
“ interior thereof. ” (Th, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Abundance</i> of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَال</span> [i. e. property, or cattle]. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَهِيرٌ</span>.

